  "description": "The works include the installation of one below-ground connection from the existing gas main in Queenstown Road/pavement to the front (north-west) of the building. A new external gas riser manifold and meter bank (comprising three meter box units) will be installed at low level beneath the windows within the front garden area (ground floor). Three gas outlets will be positioned in tandem along the front façade of the building, each serving one of the three flats. Additional internal gas outlet routes will also be installed within all three flats.",
